  "Description": "The Diagnostics goal reads a diagnostics system file and processes its content to generate a response. It first reads the contents of 'diagnosticsSystem.txt' into the variable \\%system\\%. Then, it utilizes the contents of \\%system\\% to create a structured response that includes user input, method mapping, and any error messages. Finally, it outputs the generated response.",
